/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-11T14:17:30Z","updated_at":"2025-11-11T14:20:38Z","body":"We have disabled changing the orientation for the editor because it's currently not usable in portrait mode. There is plan to eventually support portrait orientation but we first need to improve the UI/UX in landscape.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8327dfa215aa1758f2c3b99a52934172b94c134e/platform/android/java/editor/src/main/java/org/godotengine/editor/BaseGodotEditor.kt#L565-L568\n\nIf you really want to use it in portrait then you'd need to change it to `false`, to be able to change the orientation at runtime via your tool script.\n\nAlternatively, as mentioned above, you can change it in manifest as well.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3517132408/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]